        "content": "## Documentation\nThis will run wednesday, :\n- 10:00 AM UK time OR 5:00 PM PHT\n\n- Retrieve data from the steam curator: Jestr Detected\n\n- Check if the date is today, If yes retrieve. If no, do nothing.\n\n- Append to scraped campaigns (jestr detected tab)\n\n  ",
